Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.37,0:00:05.49,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,All thanks to a single queen: Yang Duanhe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:10.23,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,Feared as the Death Queen of the \Nmountains, yet beloved as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:15.87,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,That one person has managed to \Nunify the entire mountain realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.69,0:00:23.12,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,Watch. Yang Duanhe always \Noverpowers the foe head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:26.54,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Overpowers them... head-on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.13,On Top - More Top,Caption,0,0,0,,WANG
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:45.07,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Wha--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.07,0:00:46.69,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,This is just from seeing her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.13,0:00:48.56,MX Default,Lu Xian,0,0,0,,Wh-What...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:50.19,MX Default,Liewei General A,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:58.37,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Behold: The foe is chittering \Nabout something!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:01.87,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,That's their ridiculous excuse for a war cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.45,0:01:04.50,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,What is a {\i1}real{\i0} war cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:09.13,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,What is the war cry of a {\i1}real{\i0} warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:15.34,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Th-They got even louder!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:17.89,MX Default,Lu Xian,0,0,0,,Th-The ground is shaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:20.39,MX Default,Hu Jian,0,0,0,,Wh-What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:27.10,MX Default,Liewei General A,0,0,0,,What's with those troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:29.77,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,She's trying to outdo them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.77,0:01:30.86,MX Default,Hu Jian,0,0,0,,Outdo them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.60,0:01:34.37,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,I don't know what the words\N they're shouting mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:38.07,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,but Yang Duanhe is taking the enemy's \Ngreatest weapon--their morale--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:40.49,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,and attempting to smash it to pieces head-on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.95,0:01:43.86,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Do you think a little castle like that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.86,0:01:47.37,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,could ever withstand the \NMountain Queen's blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.27,0:01:52.50,Italics,Xin,0,0,0,,Th-This is the Mountain Queen's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:56.76,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Do you think it could hope to \Nfend off the mountains' blades?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:00.51,Italics,Xin,0,0,0,,Yang Duanhe's rallying cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:03.61,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Warriors of a hundred mountain tribes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.61,0:02:06.02,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Show these flatlanders, and show them well:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.45,0:02:08.02,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,The mountainfolks' might!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:10.02,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Our ferocity!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:11.65,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Turn this place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:15.82,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,into a bloodbath!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:53.21,On Top,Title,0,0,0,,STORMING LIEWEI
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:51.91,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Th-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:52.62,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Th-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.81,0:03:54.33,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,There they go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:56.04,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Wait! It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.27,0:04:01.84,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,They can't rush in like that--\Nthey'll be arrow fodder!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.19,0:04:03.19,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Ba Jio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:04.80,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.51,0:04:13.98,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Th-Those troops are lightning-fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:15.44,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,The Feima tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:18.98,MX Default,Liewei Soldier A,0,0,0,,Wha-- Who {\i1}are{\i0} these guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:21.82,MX Default,Liewei Soldier A,0,0,0,,Get inside, quickly! The enemy's upon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:24.19,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Wow! They're right on their tails!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.19,0:04:25.74,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Yeah, but before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:27.24,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,come the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:28.45,MX Default,Liewei Archer Captain,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:33.87,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,They slipped past on sheer speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:35.83,MX Default,Liewei Archer Captain,0,0,0,,No! Lower the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:37.79,MX Default,Liewei Archer Captain,0,0,0,,Lower the gate this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.79,0:04:38.71,MX Default,Liewei Soldier B,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.71,0:04:40.59,MX Default,Liewei Soldier B,0,0,0,,Hurry inside! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:41.17,MX Default,Liewei Soldier B,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.17,0:04:56.33,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,"That won't work," he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:05:00.13,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,I can hear you smiling, Tajifu,\Nbut this is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.07,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,They're gonna get themselves killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:03.13,MX Default,Zhao Soldier Walla,0,0,0,,Fire! Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:04.57,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,See?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.01,0:05:06.07,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Yang Duanhe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:07.70,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.65,0:05:11.12,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,This is pretty much how we do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:14.46,MX Default,La Mau Ji,0,0,0,,Killed off a bunch of \Nthem straight away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:17.33,MX Default,Du Ji,0,0,0,,The courage of the Feima lives in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:21.84,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:23.56,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Shall we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:26.93,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,YU
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:26.93,MX Default,Yu Feng Messenger,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:28.59,MX Default,Yu Feng Messenger,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:32.78,MX Default,Yu Feng Messenger,0,0,0,,The siege of Liewei appears to be underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.78,0:05:34.46,MX Default,Yu Feng Soldier A,0,0,0,,Whoa! That was fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:36.19,MX Default,Yu Feng Soldier B,0,0,0,,Leave it to Wang Jian!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:40.19,MX Default,Fan Yang,0,0,0,,And Ya Guang of the 1st Army \Nis spearheading the operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:45.40,MX Default,Yu Feng Messenger,0,0,0,,No, er... the siege seems \Nto be solely in the hands
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:48.68,MX Default,Yu Feng Messenger,0,0,0,,of the mountain troops\Nand the Fei Xin Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:53.20,MX Default,Yu Feng Soldier C,0,0,0,,The mountainfolk and the Fei Xin \NForce alone, taking Liewei?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:56.84,MX Default,Yu Feng Soldier D,0,0,0,,Dammit! If we hadn't been put \Non defense duty along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:59.92,MX Default,Yu Feng Soldier D,0,0,0,,the reins would never have been handed \Nto the likes of the Fei Xin Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:03.17,MX Default,Han Chang,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Wang Ben, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:07.17,MX Default,Han Chang,0,0,0,,Our break's only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.17,0:06:08.97,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,This is a crucial battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:13.17,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,I'm off to confirm commanding general \NWang Jian's intentions with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:18.10,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,You follow the plan: tend to the \Ninjured, then move on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.58,0:06:20.90,MX Default,Yu Feng Soldier,0,0,0,,Wang Ben is leaving us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:22.65,MX Default,Han Mu,0,0,0,,The Han Mu Unit will accompany him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:26.32,MX Default,Han Chang,0,0,0,,Why not be honest with yourself for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:29.11,MX Default,Han Chang,0,0,0,,Just admit you're curious \Nabout the Fei Xin Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:42.00,MX Default,Han Chang,0,0,0,,Ignoring me yet again, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:47.42,MX Default,Han Chang,0,0,0,,You know, I'd like to see the \NFei Xin Force in action myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:50.69,MX Default,Han Chang,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Fan Yang, you're in charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.69,0:06:53.39,MX Default,Fan Yang,0,0,0,,Hey! Han Chang, you little...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:59.44,MX Default,Liewei Spearman A,0,0,0,,Get them! Run 'em through!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:00.60,MX Default,Liewei Archer A,0,0,0,,Pick 'em off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.52,MX Default,Liewei Archer A,0,0,0,,Don't let the beasts reach the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:06.78,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,A-Almost time...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:10.45,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,FEI
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:10.45,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,When the gate opens, \Nwe storm the place, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.95,0:07:12.77,MX Default,Qiang Lei,0,0,0,,Don't be so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:16.37,MX Default,Soldier Walla,0,0,0,,Lieutenant! Lieutenant Qiang Lei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:19.87,MX Default,Qiang Lei,0,0,0,,These castle walls won't be \Nbreached for a while yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:25.21,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Here will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:26.66,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,La Mau Ji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.72,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Call Ba Jio and the Niaojia tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.26,0:07:32.55,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,D-Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:36.00,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,This castle's goin' nowhere fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:39.14,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Did Yang Duanhe really have no plan at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:42.50,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Maybe we got taken in by her pretty face,\N and she's actually dumb as--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:43.06,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Xin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:48.55,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,You found a way in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:51.55,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm sending up Ba Jio's unit,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.55,0:07:53.53,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,with the Niaojia tribe covering him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:57.24,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Ba Jio's doing the climbing? \NThis battle's all but won!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:08:00.70,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,But we're lacking in backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:01.96,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Backup, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:06.71,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Yes. Do you have any skilled \Narchers in your ranks?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:08.92,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Archers...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.92,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,You {\i1}bet{\i0} we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:14.93,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Some real sharpshooters, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.51,0:08:19.64,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think we shouldn't \Nhave come after all, bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:23.88,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,You dummy! You're the one who wanted \Nto go to battle in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:37.12,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Keep them nice and safe, \NYuan Jiao and Li Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:41.60,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,If you let 'em get killed, \NI'm comin' for you next!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.84,0:08:44.75,MX Default,Li Wei,0,0,0,,We'll take care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:48.55,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,Man, our captain's a real piece of work...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.55,0:08:50.71,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,Loosen up a little, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:53.98,MX Default,Li Wei,0,0,0,,We'll protect you from the enemy's arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:56.18,MX Default,Li Wei,0,0,0,,We won't let any of 'em even {\i1}graze{\i0} you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:59.14,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,Okay, Bow Bros of the Fei Xin Force:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:02.58,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,Time to show us what you can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:07.48,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Your archers look rather like children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:12.03,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,They don't just look it--\Nthey're the youngest in our unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:17.28,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,But don't you worry: \NTheir skill is the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:20.58,MX Default,Tajifu,0,0,0,,Our Niaojia archers also good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:27.58,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Well, I guess there's one thing that \Nworries me about our guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:28.62,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:31.76,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,Right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:33.74,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,This a good spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:37.88,MX Default,Li Wei,0,0,0,,The Niaojia sure did position \Nthemselves far away, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:39.64,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,So close...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:44.64,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,ZHAO
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:43.88,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,Closer than we expected... right, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:44.64,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.07,0:09:49.55,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but could the two of us \Nshoot from further back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:52.82,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about? You scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:56.53,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,I told you, our shields'll stop \Ntheir arrows in their tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:09:58.78,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,That's not it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:02.85,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Are they arguing about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:07.00,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,What worries you about those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:09.75,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,The thing about those brothers is,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:12.92,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,they ain't actually shot any {\i1}people{\i0} yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.02,0:10:15.92,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,It's begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:21.23,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,W-Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.64,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Those are the Niaojia's arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:25.10,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Hey! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:28.06,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,A new ladder--with Ba Jio's infantry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:32.48,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,All right! Now {\i1}that's{\i0} some backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.48,0:10:34.25,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Let's get Ba Jio's guys up, pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:36.53,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,What's up, Diao?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.92,0:10:39.24,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Ren and Dan--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:40.64,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,they're not doing anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:41.74,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:44.22,MX Default,Li Wei,0,0,0,,Why aren't you firing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:47.12,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,Look, don't be scared of the enemy's arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:49.58,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,W-We're too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:51.29,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,Wha... {\i1}what{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:57.00,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,We're too close! We can see \Ntheir faces too clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:10:59.38,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,What's that got to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:02.20,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,What's that--well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:07.85,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,Once we start shooting, those guys \Nwith the clear faces will be defenseless...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:09.52,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,Defenseless...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:11.04,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Dan, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:12.27,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,Bro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:16.94,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,We knew what we were getting \Nourselves into. We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:21.36,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,But two things happened \Nthat we didn't see coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:25.45,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,First, we weren't quite as\Nresolved as we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:30.78,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,And second, our hands won't stop shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:33.92,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,But it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.16,0:11:37.38,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,We can find our resolve right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.78,0:11:43.62,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,and for us, a little hand tremor at this \Ndistance will be no problem at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.26,0:11:45.97,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,But, bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:47.26,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:49.93,MX Default,Li Wei,0,0,0,,The enemy has their eyes on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:55.02,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Dan, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:11:57.74,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,While we're sitting here frozen,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:12:01.40,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,enemy arrows are killing \Nour defenseless comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:05.62,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,We'll put a stop to that. Right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.89,0:12:07.11,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,that's all there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:09.95,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Think only about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:12.46,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Now: Follow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:18.17,MX Default,Liewei Archer B,0,0,0,,M-Mǎ De!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.16,MX Default,Liewei Archer C,0,0,0,,Ti--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:22.05,MX Default,Liewei Archer C,0,0,0,,Tian Wei?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:23.47,MX Default,Liewei Archer Captain,0,0,0,,What the hell--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.26,0:12:25.89,MX Default,Zhao Soldier C,0,0,0,,C-Captain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:28.79,Italics,Zhao Soldier C,0,0,0,,All three officers, slain \Nby a single arrow each...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:31.81,Italics,Zhao Soldier C,0,0,0,,Is someone actually aiming for--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:40.42,MX Default,Archer 5,0,0,0,,Wh-What the--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:41.50,MX Default,Archer 6,0,0,0,,Where are they--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.65,0:12:44.40,MX Default,Yuan Jiao,0,0,0,,I-Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:47.91,MX Default,Li Wei,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Ren... what say you take a breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:49.18,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:50.37,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,C'mon, Dan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:52.50,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,There are too many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:55.60,MX Default,Li Wei,0,0,0,,H-He's right. Don't make him do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:56.96,MX Default,Li Wei,0,0,0,,Pitch in, little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:03.29,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,I'm on it, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:15.39,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.94,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,It's okay! Keep going, Dan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.07,0:13:22.15,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:29.78,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Don't change targets, Dan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:36.50,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,I'm not hitting! I'm aiming, \Nbut they're not landing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:37.96,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,Bro...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:41.17,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Dan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.01,0:13:44.63,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,Bro... bro...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:48.58,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Ten in a row. Watch me, Dan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:00.98,MX Default,Archer Captain B,0,0,0,,Wh-What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:21.42,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:22.67,MX Default,Archer Captain B,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:32.92,MX Default,Archer Captain,0,0,0,,He's the only one who made it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.92,0:14:34.81,MX Default,Archer Captain,0,0,0,,Surround him with shields and flatten him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:46.67,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,A-Amazing. That's our Ba Jio!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.67,0:14:48.82,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Is he doing all that alone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:52.34,MX Default,Mountainfolk Soldier,0,0,0,,--Follow Ba Jio! Keep climbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:53.37,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,--Okay, Diao, it's about that time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.37,0:14:54.33,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.33,0:14:56.58,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Now it's {\i1}our{\i0} turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.33,0:14:59.83,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,FEI
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:59.83,MX Default,Chu Shui,0,0,0,,The gate'll be opening \Nsoon! Get ready to rush in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:04.63,MX Default,Liewei Soldier B,0,0,0,,Hold them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:10.76,MX Default,Ba Jio,0,0,0,,Deduo tribe, find the gate control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:21.55,MX Default,Deduo Soldier A,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:24.56,MX Default,Liewei Guard Captain,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:38.50,MX Default,Chu Shui,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:44.67,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,WANG
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:41.95,MX Default,Aide A,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.95,0:15:44.67,MX Default,Aide B,0,0,0,,How... how can they be charging already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:54.14,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,LE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:50.80,MX Default,Hu Jian,0,0,0,,M-Meng Tian, sir, they managed \Nto open the gate that quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:52.97,MX Default,Hu Jian,0,0,0,,with a single ladder...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:54.14,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.40,0:15:56.89,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,That was unbelievably fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.27,0:16:04.19,MX Default,Fei Xin Soldier A,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, these enemies--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.19,0:16:07.72,MX Default,Chu Shui,0,0,0,,Yeah. They've been waiting for us, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.72,0:16:10.60,MX Default,Chu Shui,0,0,0,,Give it everything you've got,\N or the tides'll turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:11.29,MX Default,Fei Xin Soldier A,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:15.70,MX Default,Lu Ping,0,0,0,,Dammit! It's started!\N It's totally underway! Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:18.79,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Calm down! Do it like we \Ntrained and we'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.79,0:16:21.71,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Just stay with the squad! \NThe squad stays together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:24.66,MX Default,Lu Ping,0,0,0,,Dammit! I'm gonna kill 'em!\N I'll kill 'em all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:27.87,MX Default,Lu Ping,0,0,0,,Don't screw with me, damn you! You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.87,0:16:30.34,MX Default,Corporal Huang,0,0,0,,Lu Ping, you idiot! Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:33.47,MX Default,Ping Lai,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:35.52,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Lu Ping...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.64,MX Default,Corporal Huang,0,0,0,,Stay focused, squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:39.40,MX Default,Ping Lai,0,0,0,,Corporal Huang?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.28,0:16:42.43,MX Default,Ping Lai,0,0,0,,Gan Dou...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:44.94,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Crap, we've been scattered...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:47.65,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,And my spear's gone missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:48.86,MX Default,Enemy Soldier A,0,0,0,,He's so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:50.17,MX Default,Enemy Soldier B,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.17,0:16:53.11,MX Default,Enemy Soldier C,0,0,0,,Don't move, brat. It'll all be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:56.36,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,N-No... no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:17:01.58,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,Don't torment our promising new recruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.65,0:17:04.91,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,C-Captain Chong Yuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.17,0:17:07.94,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,Or are you more of a disappointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:11.66,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,I {\i1}told{\i0} you: Keep the squad together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:14.23,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, but Lu Ping just up and went off--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.23,0:17:15.24,MX Default,Ping Lai,0,0,0,,Gan Dou!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:17.68,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,Don't make excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:22.16,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,Hotheads like you often get all \Ngiddy in their first campaign--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:23.14,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,and die right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:29.27,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,So in a melee like this one, fight with \Nthe single purpose of staying alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:32.73,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,Manage that, and I'll give you a \Nlittle pat on the head later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.49,0:17:36.03,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,Xuan Duo, I'm putting you \Nin with these fellows.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:36.92,MX Default,Xuan Duo,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:38.96,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,Zou Shun, let's check on the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:39.66,MX Default,Zou Shun,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:41.24,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,LEI
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:42.70,MX Default,Zhao Infantry 1,0,0,0,,Lei Hua!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:44.53,MX Default,Zhao Infantry 1,0,0,0,,It's the Lei Hua Cavalry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.53,0:17:46.41,MX Default,Zhao Infantry 2,0,0,0,,Oho! Good thing they're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.88,MX Default,Fei Xin Infantry,0,0,0,,Commander Tian Yǒu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:51.29,MX Default,Zhao Infantry,0,0,0,,Go get 'em, Lei Hua Cavalry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.39,0:17:54.76,MX Default,Zou Shun,0,0,0,,Here comes trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:58.22,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,H-How can we stop something like {\i1}that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:18:00.30,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Th-They're straight-up monsters...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:03.91,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:07.14,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,Our side...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.94,0:18:09.85,MX Default,Lei Hua,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:12.07,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,...has Xin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:13.53,MX Default,Gan Dou & Ping Lai,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:17.03,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,It's hefty, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:22.33,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Wh... Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:23.80,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,S-So that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:29.29,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,...the power of General Wang Yi's poleaxe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:34.55,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Wow! Xin really mastered that thing fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:36.21,MX Default,Qing,0,0,0,,Is he for real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:39.05,MX Default,Qiang Lei,0,0,0,,You call {\i1}that{\i0} mastery?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:41.75,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Qiang Lei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:43.01,MX Default,Qiang Lei,0,0,0,,Watch carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.49,0:18:46.22,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:49.89,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Is he swinging late?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:51.15,MX Default,Qiang Lei,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:54.11,MX Default,Qiang Lei,0,0,0,,Spectacularly so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.07,0:18:57.57,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.57,0:19:00.24,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,This piece o' shit is too heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:02.62,MX Default,Wei Ping & Qing,0,0,0,,Don't call it that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.51,0:19:06.74,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Is that Shun-Men?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:11.02,MX Default,Wo Lu,0,0,0,,Hey, Xin! Keep spacing out and they're \Ngonna get all the glory for themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.53,0:19:12.65,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Like hell they will!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:15.35,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,They already opened the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:18.93,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,If they take the inside, too,\N why'd the Fei Xin Force even show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:25.60,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,C'mon, gang! We'll take control \Nof the inside and conquer Liewei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.23,0:19:36.23,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,QIN
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.23,0:19:39.74,MX Default,Qin Soldier Walla,0,0,0,,Long live the Qin army!\NLong live the Qin army!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:41.24,MX Default,Han Mu Soldier A,0,0,0,,Wha--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:43.63,MX Default,Han Mu Soldier A,0,0,0,,Liewei has fallen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:46.71,MX Default,Han Mu Soldier B,0,0,0,,Ridiculous! In just one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:49.82,MX Default,Han Mu Soldier C,0,0,0,,No, I don't think it even lasted {\i1}half{\i0} a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:56.71,MX Default,Han Chang,0,0,0,,Young lord... atop the watchtower there...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:19:59.17,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.17,0:20:00.86,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,It's that idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.17,0:20:01.51,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,FEI
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:04.93,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Liewei, Zhao's national gate, was conquered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:08.39,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The allied Qin army moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.39,0:20:13.36,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Nice of them to let us in even \Nthough we didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:16.86,MX Default,Lu Xian,0,0,0,,I was so sure our turn would come...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:20.25,MX Default,Huan Yi Soldier A,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, according to the \Nguy who got here first,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:27.87,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,HUAN
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.25,0:20:24.82,MX Default,Huan Yi Soldier A,0,0,0,,the residents took their valuables\N and split before the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:27.87,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,Tch. You're kiddin' me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.87,0:20:30.83,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,FEI
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.65,0:20:30.83,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Tend to the badly wounded--quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:34.86,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Assemble everyone who can move\Nover by Xin, Qiang Lei, and Chu Shui!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:36.78,MX Default,Yuan,0,0,0,,What, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.78,0:20:37.79,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.79,0:20:42.26,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,But we just caught our breath!\N Isn't it party time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:46.47,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? \NLiewei is only going to get busier!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.73,0:21:01.85,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Si Lu, get me a report \Non the southern boundary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.85,0:21:02.61,MX Default,Si Lu,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.61,0:21:08.03,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Huang Le, I want the accurate \Nheight and length of all four walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.03,0:21:08.78,MX Default,Huang Le,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.82,0:21:14.22,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Tian Jin, give me a full explanation \Nof the gate's construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.22,0:21:15.16,MX Default,Tian Jin,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:18.13,MX Default,General's Aide A,0,0,0,,You the Fei Xin Force?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:19.78,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:22.89,MX Default,General's Aide A,0,0,0,,Good work. We'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:25.35,MX Default,General's Aide A,0,0,0,,Stand by for further instruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.35,0:21:27.09,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:29.92,MX Default,Qing,0,0,0,,"From here"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:31.60,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Yeah, "from here."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:35.60,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,I told you, it's only going to get busier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.60,0:21:43.32,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,From now on, the Qin army has to \Ndefend Liewei as a Qin castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:48.69,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,That's why we need to get to know \Nevery nook and cranny of this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.69,0:21:52.95,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,learning all its quirks as \Nsoon as humanly possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.61,0:21:55.71,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Its... quirks?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:22:00.29,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,We may have wrenched open this \Ngate to the capital region,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:10.39,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(202,35)}TAIHANG MOUNTAINS
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:10.39,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(528,22)}HANDAN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:10.39,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(524,174)}YÈ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:10.39,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(254,218)}LIEWEI
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.62,0:22:02.80,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,but with our sights {\i1}actually{\i0} set on Yè,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:07.16,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,we really need to keep Liewei secure \Nor our supply line will get cut off--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.16,0:22:09.43,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,and we'll be in no shape to storm anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:11.75,MX Default,Aide 1,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:12.60,On Top - More Top,Caption,0,0,0,,ABOUT HALF A DAY FROM LIEWEI
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.75,0:22:14.29,MX Default,Aide 2,0,0,0,,We arrive by tomorrow morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.60,0:22:14.77,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,CHIMǍ HILL
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.43,0:22:18.48,MX Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,General, sir! An urgent message!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:19.94,MX Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,Liewei has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:21.40,MX Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,It's fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:22.71,MX Default,General's Aide A,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.71,0:22:24.69,MX Default,General's Aide B,0,0,0,,Liewei fell in a single day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.69,0:22:28.43,MX Default,General's Aide C,0,0,0,,No matter! We just march \Nright in and take it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.43,0:22:31.84,MX Default,General's Aide D,0,0,0,,But if the enemy's inside, \Nit'll turn into a castle siege.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.84,0:22:33.72,MX Default,General's Aide D,0,0,0,,I'm not sure we have the firepower!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.72,0:22:34.99,MX Default,General's Aide C,0,0,0,,It'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.99,0:22:38.50,MX Default,General's Aide C,0,0,0,,They won't be used to \Nthe place yet. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.96,0:22:42.17,MX Default,Gongsun Long,0,0,0,,All troops, halt! About face!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.79,0:22:45.45,MX Default,Gongsun Long,0,0,0,,Withdraw to Yangdu and \Ntake up position there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.12,0:22:49.13,MX Default,General's Aide A,0,0,0,,General! Are we abandoning Liewei?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.62,0:22:52.39,MX Default,Gongsun Long,0,0,0,,Worry not. Yes, it's been conquered--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.39,0:22:54.97,MX Default,Gongsun Long,0,0,0,,but only until they fall victim to its trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.06,0:22:58.60,MX Default,General's Aide A,0,0,0,,I-Its trick, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.14,0:23:05.11,MX Default,Gongsun Long,0,0,0,,Indeed. Within Liewei is concealed \Na scheme devised by Li Mu himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.52,0:23:12.91,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,So that's how it is, Li Mu?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:18.58,MX Default - Right Align,Caption,0,0,0,,TRANSLATION: NORA STEVENS HEATH \NTIMING: HENRY LIN\NEDITING AND QA: SARAH ALYS LINDHOLM
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.00,0:24:55.01,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,LIEWEI'S TRAP
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.30,0:24:52.80,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next on Kingdom: "Liewei's Trap."

